MAX_RESULTS: is 12
MAX_ACTIONS: is 40
MAX_RESULT_CHARS: is 600
MAX_MESSAGE_CHARS: is 4000
FAILURE: matches the words traceback, panic and timed out
clip: returns s.slice(0, n) followed by a count of the remaining characters when s is longer than n
textOf: joins the text of every block whose type is "text"
selectResults: returns the results unchanged when there are no more than max
normalizeLastTurn: starts from the last user message that has text and is not a tool result
Msg: has a role, optional content and optional tool_calls
